  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To carry out the following work: Successful design, implementation and supervision of the WHS+ and/or WHO  Island States Health Examination Survey Plus (WISHES+) and data management and meta/micro data documentation and dissemination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;WHO requires the successful bidder, the Contractor, to design, implement and/or supervise the World Health Survey Plus (WHS+) and/or the WHO Island States Health Examination Survey Plus (WISHES+) and/or collate/edit/weight raw micro data and/or document and disseminate meta/micro data.

HelpAge Myanmar oversees the implementation of this project in 5 countries, with the support of network members:
Cambodia, Sri Lanka, Indonesia, Timor-Leste, Maldives&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
